<<showCharacter "Lina" "SofieSpeakingTired">>
Sofie: Really? Yay! Can I open it now, please?
<<showCharacter "Lina" "SofieListeningTired">>
-> Mailman: Of course, here you go.
    <<jump AEnd1Day1>>
-> Mailman: Here you go, sweetheart, I hope you have a wonderful first day of school with it.
    <<jump AEnd2Day1>>
