//FAM B — DAY 3 — BAIT (PRISTINE / SLIGHTLY DAMAGED)
<<set $relationshipFamB += 1>>
<<setBackground "BGFamB">>
<<showCharacter "Gertrude" "Happy">>
Mailman: Good afternoon Gertrude! 
<<showCharacter "Gertrude" "TalkingHappy">>
Gertrude: Just the person I was hoping to see, I have here a box of vegetables that we are not going to eat. Do you know anyone who might want them?
<<showCharacter "Gertrude" "Happy">>
Mailman: I might know a boy that might benefit from adding home grown vegetables to his meals, he is just about one year old now so he needs the best food to grow strong.
<<showCharacter "Gertrude" "TalkingHappy">>
Gertrude: That's wonderful! I'm going to get the box, I'll also call Mikkel so he can receive the package you brought.
<<showCharacter "Mikkel" "Worried">>
