<<showCharacter "Mikkel" "TalkingHappy">>
Mikkel: Good afternoon, Mr.Mailman. I thought you were avoiding me, did you come to surrender?
<<showCharacter "Mikkel" "Worried">>
Mailman: I would never surrender. Are you scared to lose? 
<<showCharacter "Mikkel" "TalkingHappy">>
Mikkel: Scared of you? Never! You are, in fact, holding the main part of our bet.
<<showCharacter "Mikkel" "Worried">>
Mailman: Are these the worms? 
<<receivePackage true>>
<<showCharacter "Mikkel" "TalkingHappy">>
Mikkel: That's right, we have everything ready. Whenever you feel ready to challenge me, you know where to find me. 
<<showCharacter "Mikkel" "Worried">>
Mailman: That's right and if you want to surrender you have my phone number on the receipt.
<<showCharacter "Gertrude" "TalkingHappy">>
Gertrude: For him to surrender he would have to die, here you have the vegetables. I hope the kids can enjoy them.
<<giveItem "vegetables">>
<<showCharacter "Gertrude" "Happy">>
Mailman: I will make sure they receive it. Be ready Mikkel.
<<hideCharacter "Mikkel">>
<<hideCharacter "Gertrude">>
<<hideBackground>>
===

