<<set $famB_breakCount += 1>>
<<showCharacter "Gertrude" "Worried">>
Mailman: Good afternoon Gertrude! 
<<showCharacter "Gertrude" "TalkingWorried">>
Gertrude: Just the person I was hoping to see, I have here a box of vegetables that we are not going to eat. Do you know anyone who might want them?
<<showCharacter "Gertrude" "Worried">>
Mailman: I might know a boy that might benefit from adding home grown vegetables to his meals, he is just about one year old now so he needs the best food to grow strong.
<<showCharacter "Gertrude" "TalkingWorried">>
Gertrude: That's wonderful! I'm going to get the box, I'll also call Mikkel so he can receive the package you brought.
<<showCharacter "Gertrude" "Worried">>
Mailman: I would appreciate it a lot, we have matters to discuss.
<<showCharacter "Mikkel" "TalkingWorried">>
Mikkel: Good afternoon, Mr.Mailman. I thought you were avoiding me, did you come to surrender?
<<showCharacter "Mikkel" "Worried">>
Mailman: I would never surrender. Are you scared to lose? 
<<showCharacter "Mikkel" "TalkingWorried">>
Mikkel: Scared of you? Never! You, in fact, have tried to sabotage me by breaking the package.
<<receivePackage true>>
<<showCharacter "Mikkel" "Worried">>
Mailman: Are these the worms? 
<<showCharacter "Mikkel" "TalkingWorried">>
Mikkel: That's right, I'm sure your attempts to cheat were unsuccessful. Whenever you feel ready to challenge me like a real man, you know where to find me. 
<<showCharacter "Gertrude" "Worried">>
Mailman: That's right and if you want to surrender you have my phone number on the receipt.
<<showCharacter "Gertrude" "TalkingWorried">>
Gertrude: For him to surrender he would have to die, here you have the vegetables. I hope the kids can enjoy them.
<<giveItem "vegetables">>
<<showCharacter "Gertrude" "Worried">>
Mailman: I will make sure they receive it. Be ready Mikkel.
<<hideCharacter "Mikkel">>
<<hideCharacter "Gertrude">>
<<hideBackground>>
===

